---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Groups - Ferment UI">
  <main>
    <h1>Groups</h1>
    <p>Grouped pattern collections and pattern combinations for complex UI components.</p>
    
    <section>
      <h2>Form Groups</h2>
      <p>Grouped form patterns and form-related component combinations will be documented here.</p>
    </section>
    
    <section>
      <h2>Navigation Groups</h2>
      <p>Complex navigation patterns and grouped navigation components will be shown here.</p>
    </section>
    
    <section>
      <h2>Content Groups</h2>
      <p>Content-focused pattern groups and layout combinations will be documented here.</p>
    </section>
    
    <section>
      <h2>Interactive Groups</h2>
      <p>Complex interactive pattern combinations will be listed here.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>